    (∀ i ∈ A, ∀ j ∈ B, (m:ℝ)/(4*t) ≤ normalizedA t i-normalizedA t j ∧
      (m:ℝ)/(4*t) ≤ normalizedB t i-normalizedB t j) ∧
    (∀ z ∈ Icc 0 (Real.log (7/6)), let X := scaleX η t z
